{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "00a2ac8f19f639ac7fab993344b9b48be253ced55a4c4a79aa73393fa4e5817d", "ja": "やっほー{$P$}！\nどう？　私の衣装！　ピカピカしてるでしょ～？", "zh": "呀吼——{$P$}！\n怎么样？我的演出服！亮晶晶的吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ded9c1c6e2155f531be8f797c3b5629c56386c4d400d2ccca329f16ad763eb10", "ja": "静香……？　どうしたんだ……？", "zh": "静香……？怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "3254b0e1414e8763c65d3b50df05fdd13f5c64f39605cb7400b827fd8b552118", "ja": "はあ～……ちゃんと受け答えしてくれないと、練習に\nならないじゃないですか！　しっかりしてください！", "zh": "唉～……你好歹好好回应一下啊，不然根本没法练习！打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2f657616e55b4427297e7170a285d8f22aa19886dfaeb0ed91a12bcbc0953082", "ja": "えっ？　練習？", "zh": "咦？练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "3a1d421027ec2a3e810debe844500aded04ecdfeaa2eda0268456866aaf1084b", "ja": "ええ、そうです。この衣装、\n『太陽の魔法少女』をモチーフにしたんですよね？", "zh": "是的，没错。这套服装是以《太阳的魔法少女》为主题设计的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "50130161caaadec07430a5f57990c9d0fa00097fb756e08dd2919b156ebca768", "ja": "鏡をみると、自分じゃないようで戸惑いますけど。でも\nいただいた衣装とお仕事は、しっかりやりたいんです。", "zh": "照镜子的时候，总觉得自己好像变成了另一个人，实在有些不知所措。不过，既然是您给我的服装和工作，我一定会好好完成的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "67e0c5eefbc0db77257300443a985926393216dee2b01cc58611e272dc832873", "ja": "だから、この姿に合わせた振る舞いができるように\nなろうと思って、いろいろ練習をしていたんです。", "zh": "所以，为了学会符合这个形象的举止，我一直在练习各种各样的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "19c59e4ee72ab533a05373bae923d839f3f93cc353e8b9e21a8006760f1b470b", "ja": "そうだったのか。静香は、さっきみたいな感じが\n太陽の魔法少女だと考えてるのか？", "zh": "原来是这样。静香，你觉得刚才那种感觉，就是太阳魔法少女的样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "a7974412be45051480ba0ef5221b8e5bd2c7cfa3348747b5f1a158fb07cc05ca", "ja": "はい。魔法少女作品をいくつか見ましたが、太陽の\n魔法少女だと思ったのは、大体ああいう感じかなと。", "zh": "是的。我看过几部魔法少女作品，不过我觉得，所谓太阳的魔法少女，大概就是刚才那种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "255c2cf40f50b1e47366ced263318c957923aafa5076a1d47da711c9b27f4fc0", "ja": "なるほどな……。\n他には、気づいたことはないのか？", "zh": "原来如此……还有没有注意到其他什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "5ca7c71cbf44fdb65716ff47e2d7926bf696f5b0c2a13465d838ea9dfab3e47e", "ja": "そうですね……。流行っている魔法少女アニメの\n主人公は、優しさで人々を救い、勇気を与えてました。", "zh": "是啊……最近流行的魔法少女动画里，主人公用温柔拯救人们，给予他们勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "568c0b5560698da4d8d7c6437f46b30332b52da8c29cfc7eb71809a60e04042d", "ja": "あと、特撮作品も参考になると思って見てみたんです。\nそれぞれが仲間を支える姿は素敵でした。他にも……。", "zh": "另外，我觉得特摄作品也能作为参考，就看了一下。\n大家互相支持彼此的身影真的很棒。还有就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "5415a3f311d007dc142cf6beff10ffe3b574975f56c2685f0a26c0a1e57b05e4", "ja": "これまでの魔法少女が全員登場した時は……ハッ！\nあっ……私……。", "zh": "当之前的魔法少女们全都登场时……哈！  \n啊……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1013_p", "source_sha256": "49efccddf69aaed2a8249dbc98a410b681580ff9620d6e410bc5f7b6df293a2f", "ja": "すごいな！　かなりいろんな作品を見てきたんだな。\n数えきれないぐらい作品名が出てきて驚いたよ。", "zh": "真厉害啊！看来你看过相当多不同的作品呢。\n一口气说出了多到数不清的作品名，真让我吃了一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "0560e33c68ce4994904524545c35b0c497c0458a09f9709f9badb0d8bbc1ab54", "ja": "まあ、これぐらいは……。\nそれで、{$P$}はどう思いますか？", "zh": "嘛，这点程度……。\n那么，{$P$}觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f0049b488f73590396d7502d3a8ab1486e5ab58f0346351bbb4363db4008c4f8", "ja": "どうって？　……ああ！　静香の演技が、\n太陽の魔法少女像に近いかってことか？", "zh": "你是问什么？……啊！是问静香的演技，和太阳魔法少女的形象像不像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "3eb7be9965bbba502c83ea0c07088c9b7bc425061299b8563ec196dc27bb1fc7", "ja": "はい。私に遠慮せず、はっきり言ってください！\nそうじゃないと、参考になりませんから。", "zh": "是的。请不要顾虑我，直截了当地告诉我！\n不然就没法作为参考了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2fc7b60978aa2e92551168e64c3af72e29dadcdd4469f24ff906ecdf9ba50549", "ja": "そうだな……。\nはっきりいうと……ちょっと違う気はした、かな？", "zh": "确实啊……\n坦白说……总觉得有点不太一样，是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "766ed0b3d4092d7f0592eb08e85cf2b34eb96cd6ed930d8f6489fc4c8e7f88a1", "ja": "やっぱり……そうですよね。自分でも薄々わかっては\nいたんです。……どこが違うんだろう……どうすれば。", "zh": "果然……是这样啊。其实我自己也有隐隐约约\n察觉到。……到底是哪里不对呢……该怎么办才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1019_p", "source_sha256": "25568d7cbebfdfaa50faf2e3e77ad226de6f37bedb42a2d840213aa7357b2e37", "ja": "そうだ！　こういう時は、身近な人のマネをすると\nイメージが掴みやすいって聞いたことがあるぞ！", "zh": "对了！我听说这种时候，模仿身边的人会更容易找到感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "f957e6c35dbe543934a37aa6fe6e1ef91006c6a1a53ab07e7217ba5aa2d5a19c", "ja": "身近な人……私なら、劇場のみんなでしょうか？\n「くふふ、静香はすっごく強くなったんだぞ～！」", "zh": "身边的人……如果是我的话，应该就是剧场的大家吧？\n“咯咯咯，静香已经变得超强了哦～！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1021_p", "source_sha256": "36e6a524c1f0a0eb23c38bb75285cad2ed4f98c326e253e95fecd10bd74502f9", "ja": "いや、静香、そういうことじゃ……。", "zh": "不，静香，不是那么回事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "8d47350ea99b0f8af5633d747b17c5e01b8335004571a6451d6e0d93f5eb351d", "ja": "「私は、太陽の戦士。何も怖いものはありません！」\nあっ！　今何か掴めそうな気がしました……！", "zh": "“我是太阳的战士。没有什么好害怕的！”\n啊！刚才好像抓到某种感觉了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c63c0750cdba4d9e02909802a610e5daf01cb42450c9cb75282580208b056a3d", "ja": "……そ、そうか！　よし、じゃあそこに静香の良さを\nたくさん足して静香らしい太陽の魔法少女を目指そう！", "zh": "……这、这样啊！好，那就再多多融入\n静香自身的优点，以充满静香特色的太阳魔法少女为目标吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0374_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "6bbb346cf7c5f0c344c5ac100e2fb4e2c68869a769003c9d077eaad54988d29e", "ja": "私らしい魔法少女……。そうですね、魔法少女として\n輝けるように、もっと研究してみますね♪　ふふっ。", "zh": "属于我的魔法少女……嗯，说得也是。为了成为闪耀的魔法少女，我会再多做些研究♪ 嘻嘻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
